# Wayfinder scratch worktree

`.scratch/` is the Wayfinder tracker (maps, tickets, specs, graph). It is **not** product code.

- Checkout: sibling worktree `../satisfactorymap-scratch` on branch `scratch/vertical-builds`.
- Commit tracker/map/spec/graph/star-map changes **on that branch only**, then `git push origin scratch/vertical-builds`.
- Never merge `scratch/vertical-builds` into `main`. Never `git add .scratch/` while on `main`.
- Product work stays on feature branches from `main` in `../satisfactorymap`.
- Glossary for this map: `CONTEXT.md` at the scratch worktree root.
